# Node006
{350}{}{I am Kiru, and you stand within the walls of Fort Aradesh. This place was once an oil refinery. We settled here four years ago, having journeyed from Hoover Dam, and established a humble community. The NCR Rangers offered protection until they were overwhelmed by the raiders. We have barricaded ourselves inside, awaiting aid from the NCR. It has been quite some time, but we can still hear the agonizing cries of the fallen. It is a harrowing ordeal.}
{351}{}{Who is the dead guy bound to the pipe?}
{352}{}{It seems that help will not arrive. I am the closest assistance you will receive.}

# Node007
